                    <msContents>
                        <summary>An illustrated otogizōshi handscroll. Although bearing the title
                            Hinazuru (ひな鶴), its contents correspond to the tale conventionally
                            known as Sazareishi, a celebratory narrative in which Princess
                            Sazareishi, daughter of Emperor Seimu, attains longevity and prosperity
                            through her devotion to Yakushi Nyorai.</summary>
                        <textLang mainLang="ja">Japanese</textLang>
                        <msItem>
                            <author key="">Unknown</author>
                            <title key="">ひな鶴</title>
                            <title key="">Hinazuru</title>
                            <note>Handscroll</note>
                        </msItem>
                    </msContents>
